# Hooks

| Hook | Job |
|------|-----|
| `pre_prompt.py` | TTY → checklist UI; skip on `--no-input` / non-TTY |
| `interactive_prompts.py` | Wizard; auto-enable Redis/ASGI deps; force pre-commit if none picked |
| `pre_gen_project.py` | Hard fail on bad slug, WS/Celery deps, empty pre-commit |
| `post_gen_project.py` | Delete unused auth/CI/proxy/Celery/WS/tests/rules/docs |

- Exit 143 after interactive generate is normal (outer cookiecutter SIGTERM).
- `init.sh` wraps the same UI path.
